Name: AndroidX Work Manager Runtime
Short Name: work-runtime
URL: https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/work#2.9.0
Version: 2.9.0
License: Apache Version 2.0
License File: LICENSE
CPEPrefix: unknown
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
WorkManager is an API that makes it easy to schedule deferrable, asynchronous 
tasks that are expected to run even if the app exits or the device restarts.

This library provides runtime components for scheduling and executing background 
work in Android applications within the Chromium browser.

Local Modifications:
None. Used as-is from the official AndroidX release.

Update Process:
1. Download the AAR from https://maven.google.com/androidx/work/work-runtime/
2. Extract JAR from AAR for build system compatibility
3. Update version numbers in BUILD.gn and this README
4. Test integration with Chrome Android build
5. Update dependencies if needed

Dependencies:
- androidx.lifecycle:lifecycle-service
- androidx.room:room-runtime  
- androidx.sqlite:sqlite
- androidx.concurrent:concurrent-futures
- androidx.annotation:annotation

Integration Notes:
- Requires manifest additions for WorkManager services
- ProGuard rules included for release builds
- Initialized through Chrome Application class